 "summary": "A single white surface-mount LED in the 0805 chip outline (2.0 × 1.25 mm, 0.85 mm high) under a flat yellow lens. Driven at 5 mA it gives 145 to 360 mcd over a 120 degree viewing angle, with a forward drop of 2.6 to 3.1 V and a white point near x 0.25, y 0.23. Parts are sorted into intensity, forward-voltage and colour bins. It is RoHS compliant, made for automatic placement and infrared reflow, and comes 3000 to a reel on 8 mm tape.",
